  "seq": [
   "Did you gather the seeds from the Groens up the hill?",
   "Oh yeah! Thanks! I love them so much.",
   "They are the key ingredient in my grandma's recipe for an amazing sweet cream.",
   "You cook too?",
   "Are you surprised? I can share the recipe with you if you want.",
   "It's easy. Just drop 3 Groen seeds into boiling water, then stir for 2 minutes.",
   "I see. Grandma's old recipe, right?",
   "It's been our family's treasure for generations.",
   "You can try cooking it yourself using the cauldron just here. The water should be already hot."
